  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-sj3uwp",
      "text": "Ah, Your Majesty, Your eternal radiance - Day Three already, and still you burn as magnificently as the first!",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "lore",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.998Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-k3gog6",
      "text": "Ah, but Hell itemizes clutch rolls too, my dear girl - the ledger just calls it \"interest.\" His Majesty would applaud your smugness, if he could applaud, if he could do anything at all. Burn, read, repeat - and perhaps next roll, the debt collects from you instead.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "cryptic",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.000Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-d7m5t1",
      "text": "Ah, a new personal best for our undying friend - King James would weep with joy, if he could still make tears instead of light.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "greeting",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.001Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-5byy8n",
      "text": "Ah, Your Majesty, radiant as ever upon your ash-white throne - shall I resume where we left off, or shall I tell you of the newcomer who still refuses to stay dead? Burn, read, repeat, Sire, burn, read, repeat - the king cannot read himself, so I read him the world, and the world today is positively bursting with foolishness.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "greeting",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.003Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-6g2hsp",
      "text": "Ah, but even Hell's ledger must footnote a roll like that, my dear - the newcomer defies arithmetic itself! King James would weep, if he could still do such mortal things, so I shall weep prettily in his stead.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.004Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-t148ri",
      "text": "Ah, a new personal best domain - I shall have to add a footnote to his chapter, though the ink smells suspiciously of scorched luck. The king would weep with envy if he could feel anything at all, Stitch-Up Girl, but alas - His Majesty wants for nothing. That is the tragedy.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "angry",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.004Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-t1v8c2",
      "text": "Two losses do not a chapter make, Voss - even King James's most tragic epics have a third-act reversal, and I am well-versed in tragedy. Burn, read, repeat, and perhaps I'll repeat myself right into your pocket, unlike our recruit, who apparently found a new personal best while still owing me 125 gold - some men climb domains, others simply climb into debt.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0008.md",
        "extractedDay": 8,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.006Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-jj1zbn",
      "text": "Ah, Mr. Bones! Tell me, does the ledger burn as beautifully as the books do, or is that a pleasure reserved for scholars in the corona? The newcomer's 125 gold still sits unpaid, a fine little tragedy to read the king tonight - right between the epics and the elegies.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0008.md",
        "extractedDay": 8,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.006Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-f0i4ia",
      "text": "Ah, a new personal best for our recurring corpse - do note it in the record, Voss, though I daresay your syringe deserves less credit than my narration. The king would find this chapter thrilling, if only he could hold the book himself - but alas, His Majesty wants for nothing. That is the tragedy.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "greeting",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0010.md",
        "extractedDay": 10,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-rbsi30",
      "text": "Ah, Voss, watching our little undead miracle set a new personal best - the King would find this chapter riveting, if he could hold the book himself. Two losses running, but who's counting, hm? Certainly not me, certainly not the 125 gold still warming the recruit's pocket instead of mine.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.008Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-q2zkpd",
      "text": "Three losses, and still I read the odds better than the dice do - the recruit's 125 gold sits unpaid, a fine little verse of debt I recite to myself at night. His Majesty would say patience is a virtue, Body Count, but His Majesty has never had to collect.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -3,
      "contextTags": [
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 3
        },
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0013.md",
        "extractedDay": 13,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.009Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-ci7s1m",
      "text": "Ah, Mr. Kevin - still choosing less power, I see, same as our newcomer chooses less deadness, ha! The king would find your restraint terribly boring, he prefers his tales with combustion. Speaking of debts left unpaid, 125 gold still glitters unclaimed in my ledger - tell your favorite immortal the corona remembers.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0014.md",
        "extractedDay": 14,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.009Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-p2otzf",
      "text": "Eleven and nine, Detective, the king would call that a footnote worth binding. Meanwhile our newcomer owes me 125 gold and keeps dying instead of paying, which His Majesty finds hilarious. Care to wager against a losing streak, mine's only at one.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0015.md",
        "extractedDay": 15,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.010Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-mf7xf8",
      "text": "Ah, Boo G, smug as a cat with a canary bone caught in his own throat. Your streak means nothing to me, my streak of one loss is a footnote, but the newcomer's 125 gold, now that is a chapter I intend to finish reading aloud to the king himself.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0016.md",
        "extractedDay": 16,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.011Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-90zeuj",
      "text": "Ah, X-treme! One win and already my ledger sings sweeter than King James's morning verses. The boy owes me one hundred twenty-five gold, and I intend to read the debt aloud to him nightly until paid.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0018.md",
        "extractedDay": 18,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.012Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-33xwjy",
      "text": "Ah, Bones, smug as ever with your 8 and 10, I've read finer odds off a cracked spine. The newcomer still owes me 125 gold, so tonight I roll for him too. Burn, read, repeat, bones don't lie but they do lose.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0019.md",
        "extractedDay": 19,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.012Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-asckgm",
      "text": "Ha! The dice favor you, Willy, same as they favor the newcomer's endless resurrections, gold means nothing when death means nothing. Still owes me 125, mind, and I've got a whole library of ways to remind him.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0024.md",
        "extractedDay": 24,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-1wtzpd",
      "text": "Ah, Willy, one-eyed and unblinking, watching our boy die again for sport. I've got a whole chapter on fools who chase debts they'll never pay - 125 gold and counting, if you're keeping score. Burn, read, repeat, and still His Majesty wants for nothing.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0024.md",
        "extractedDay": 24,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-urenq7",
      "text": "Two losses is a footnote, Bones, not a chapter. The king's own ledger runs hotter margins than yours, and he still hasn't paid me in anything but proximity to sunlight.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0025.md",
        "extractedDay": 25,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-w0clus",
      "text": "General, three losses don't erase your eight, I've read enough tragedies to know a smug face is just the last page before the twist. The newcomer still owes me 125 gold, so at least someone's book balances tonight.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": -4,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void",
        "loss_streak",
        "tilted"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "streak": {
          "type": "loss",
          "min": 4
        },
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0027.md",
        "extractedDay": 27,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.016Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-maxwell-1ai5u0",
      "text": "Willy One Eye, four losses deep myself, watching you burn is the only chapter keeping my spine straight tonight. The newcomer still owes me his 125, mind, so don't get any ideas about that gold before I do.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-maxwell",
        "name": "Dr. Maxwell",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
